      <problem>
        <paragraph>Find $$\frac{f\left( {x + h} \right) - f(x)}{h}$$ given $$f(x) = 2x^{2} - 3x$$ on $$\lbrack x,x + h\rbrack$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
