    <heading level="1">Extension</heading>
    <exercise number="41" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>The graph of the function $$f$$ is shown in Figure 18.</paragraph>
        <figure number="18">
          <image alt="Graph of f(x) on a graphing calculator."/>
        </figure>
        <paragraph>Based on the calculator screen shot, the point $$(1.333, 5.185)$$ is which of the following?</paragraph>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>ⓐa relative (local) maximum of the function</item>
          <item>ⓑthe vertex of the function</item>
          <item>ⓒthe absolute maximum of the function</item>
          <item>ⓓa zero of the function</item>
        </list>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>A</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
